version: "1.0.9"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZhiPeng1022/pappa2-tal-analysis-unit-sensitivity"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, curated derived tables, and generated figures for
  complete-data donor pseudobulk, Milo neighborhood, neighborhood-expression
  association, within-donor cell-rank, donor-stratified signature transfer,
  kidney eQTL and snATAC context, composition-expression decomposition,
  independent non-KPMP validation, a prespecified 400-gene analysis-unit
  sensitivity panel, a reusable unitaware Python package, and effect-aware
  conditional-null calibration in human kidney thick ascending limb subtypes.
keywords:
  - human kidney
  - thick ascending limb
  - single-nucleus RNA sequencing
  - Milo
  - analysis-unit sensitivity
  - single-cell genomics
  - reproducible software
